# Production dependencies allowed to reach the network.
# Owned by .claude/scripts/check-no-network-egress.sh, whose header owns this format; every
# entry is an owner decision under CLAUDE.md § Hard constraints.
better-sqlite3 a native addon (binding.gyp, prebuilt .node binaries) embedding SQLite in-process for @cram/index (#11, docs/adr/0004-storage.md); it exposes no socket API and opens no connection
node-addon-api better-sqlite3's C++ header dependency; flagged only for tools/clang-format.js, a maintainer formatting script that spawns clang-format and is never loaded at runtime
